  * Airport layouts (src/airport/aptdat.rs, aptgeo.rs): taxi route networks,
    startup / gate positions, pavement, painted lines, taxiway lights, signs,
    windsocks and tower positions from X-Plane apt.dat airport data —
    the X-Plane Scenery Gateway community airports (© Robin A. Peel,
